{"seq":10,"slug":"ecology","title":"生态学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology","introMarkdown":"# 生态学\n\n我决定认真自学生态学，是因为有一年夏天回到老家，发现小时候捉鱼的那条河变浅了、岸边的芦苇换成了一片陌生的水葫芦。我想弄明白：一条河、一片林子、一群动物，到底是按什么规律在运转？为什么一个外来物种能在几年里改写整片湿地的样子？这些问题没有简单答案，但它们正是生态学要回答的。\n\n生态学研究的是生物与生物之间、生物与环境之间的相互关系。它的尺度跨度极大——小到一只田鼠如何在冬天保住体温，大到整个地球的碳如何在大气、海洋和森林之间循环。正因为尺度多变，初学时很容易迷失方向。所以这本手册沿着生态学经典的\"层级\"展开：从个体与种群，到群落，再到生态系统，最后落到人类最关心的应用与保护。这条线索是大多数大学《普通生态学》教材的骨架，跟着走不会乱。\n\n第一章从个体与种群讲起。我们会看生物如何适应环境，种群数量为什么有时指数暴涨、有时稳定在某个水平，以及生物用怎样的\"生活史策略\"在繁殖与生存之间权衡。\n\n第二章进入群落。多个种群共享同一片空间，于是有了竞争、捕食、共生这些精彩的相互作用，也有了物种多样性的高低之分，还有群落随时间演替的故事。\n\n第三章上升到生态系统，关注的不再是\"谁吃谁\"，而是能量如何沿食物链流动、氮和磷这些营养元素如何循环往复，以及一个生态系统为什么有的稳健、有的脆弱。\n\n第四章回到现实。2026 年的今天，IPBES 估计约有一百万个物种面临灭绝威胁，而全球每年流向破坏生物多样性的资金高达数万亿美元，远超用于保护的投入。我们会讨论生物多样性的价值、保护的具体策略，以及在气候变化背景下生态恢复能做什么、不能做什么。\n\n我写这本手册时尽量避免堆砌术语。每一节都先用大白话讲清核心概念，再用例子和图把机制讲透，然后留几道自测题让你检验理解，最后给一些能联系现实的延伸阅读。数学不可避免——种群增长、能量效率都要用公式——但我会把每个符号的含义讲明白，不让公式吓退人。\n\n如果你和我一样，是带着对自然的好奇而不是考试压力来的，那么这本手册希望陪你把\"为什么\"一个个问清楚。读完之后，再去看一条河、一片林子，你看到的将不再只是风景，而是一张正在运转的关系网。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"individual-and-population-ecology","title":"个体与种群生态学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/individual-and-population-ecology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"organism-and-environment","title":"生物与环境：适应与耐受","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/individual-and-population-ecology/organism-and-environment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"population-growth-models","title":"种群增长模型：从指数到逻辑斯谛","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/individual-and-population-ecology/population-growth-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"population-regulation-and-life-history","title":"种群调节与生活史策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/individual-and-population-ecology/population-regulation-and-life-history"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"community-ecology","title":"群落生态学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/community-ecology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"community-structure-and-diversity","title":"群落结构与物种多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/community-ecology/community-structure-and-diversity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"species-interactions","title":"物种间的相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/community-ecology/species-interactions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"succession-and-community-dynamics","title":"群落演替与动态","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/community-ecology/succession-and-community-dynamics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecosystem-ecology","title":"生态系统生态学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/ecosystem-ecology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"energy-flow-and-trophic-levels","title":"能量流动与营养级","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/ecosystem-ecology/energy-flow-and-trophic-levels"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nutrient-cycling","title":"营养物质循环","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/ecosystem-ecology/nutrient-cycling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecosystem-productivity-and-stability","title":"生态系统的生产力与稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/ecosystem-ecology/ecosystem-productivity-and-stability"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applied-ecology-and-conservation","title":"应用生态学与生物多样性保护","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/applied-ecology-and-conservation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"biodiversity-and-its-value","title":"生物多样性及其价值","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/applied-ecology-and-conservation/biodiversity-and-its-value"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conservation-strategies","title":"生物多样性保护策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/applied-ecology-and-conservation/conservation-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-change-and-ecological-restoration","title":"全球变化与生态恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/applied-ecology-and-conservation/global-change-and-ecological-restoration"}]}]}